ap both horiz and vert.\nSAM MFD azimuth selection is now used if its less than auto azimuth.\nSmall rework of doppler vs. non-doppler terrain interrogation.\nFix strange maketimer issue.", "created_at": "2022-02-11T20:01:10Z", "repo": "flightgear-saab-ja-37-viggen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "20afc56d0cbd9f06c8d15743ad62f2bc119982f8", "message": "missile: Thread safe write to model-added/removed", "created_at": "2022-02-11T20:01:10Z", "repo": "flightgear-saab-ja-37-viggen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7709e700a43540ff813d0ed669d70ad74afa175f", "message": "Radar: New generic radar system", "created_at": "2022-02-11T19:55:43Z", "repo": "flightgear-saab-ja-37-viggen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c3a5eaf6c837c616b030c4167194e0b8d1f925bc", "message": "Nasal: update vector.nas to 2.00\n\nThis version is not backward compatible: the meanings of\n    rollPitchYawVector\n    yawPitchRollVector\nhave been inverted.\nAffected files: light-manager.nas, missile.nas\n\n(version 2.00 required for new radar system)", "created_at": "2022-02-11T19:54:02Z", "repo": "flightgear-saab-ja-37-viggen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bd30cffd1de39cbc3644c0266a4425bd79b252cf", "message": "Radar: Some comments changed.\nRadar: Fixed check for behind earth curvature sqrt could not handle a negative number with very low magnitude.", "created_at": "2020-05-28T02:48:42Z", "repo": "flightgear-saab-ja-37-viggen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "731c35ce2cea89959e9686bd68f6b0bfd38ae19c", "message": "Radar: Some work I did on the prototype a while back. Hope I recovered it correct from git stash before the file was moved.", "created_at": "2020-05-28T02:05:46Z", "repo": "flightgear-saab-ja-37-viggen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_